  :drawbacks ("Does not capture spread; always report stat/sd or stat/variance alongside mean." "Fails to represent multimodal data (e.g., bimodal distributions where the mean falls between two peaks)." "Assumes numeric data; categorical or ordinal data should use stat/mode or stat/median instead.")
  :usecases ("Center data for regression, hypothesis testing, and control-chart monitoring." "Report typical value for normally distributed data." "Compute z-scores: (value − mean) / sd." "Track mean over time to detect process drift.")
