  :usecases ("Detect data validity: min should exceed a known lower bound." "Compute range as stat/max − stat/min." "Rescale data: divide by stat/max, or normalize to [0, 1] using min and max." "Monitor system limits: ensure sensor readings never drop below device minimum.")
  :related ("stat/max" "stat/range" "stat/quartile" "stat/median" "stat/mean")
  :learn (:concept "Order statistics: extreme and percentile-based values; min and max are the first and nth ranks." :prerequisites ("core: list, map" "stat/max") :progression "Pair min and max for range; then explore stat/median and stat/quartile for middle ranks and robust summaries.")
