  :impl-file "src/wired-verbs.js"
  :impl-notes "Two-pass: mean, then sum-of-squared-deviations divided by (n-1). Empty or single-element list returns 0 (NOT 'nan or 'no-spread as older docs claimed). Impl is permissive on degenerate cases."
